# Project planning (private notes)
docs/portfolio-improvement-plan.md
docs/software-engineering-guide.md
.nx/polygraph
.claude/settings.local.json

.claude/worktrees

# AI agent instructions regenerated on every session by the nx@nx-claude-plugins
# plugin enabled in .claude/settings.json. One copy per detected tool, so they
# are reproducible from the plugin and do not belong in review diffs.
# run-task-workflow is hand-written and stays tracked.
.agents/skills/*
!.agents/skills/run-task-workflow/
.codex/
.opencode/
opencode.json
.github/agents/
.github/prompts/
.github/skills/